OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear skies and light winds to begin
OL,7,Fthe evening. Some low cloud, mist and
OL,8,Ffog patches forming in some prone
OL,9,Fspots by morning, mostly across the
OL,10,Fsouth of the region. Chillier than of
OL,11,Flate.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FFog and low cloud clear,
OL,14,Flingering in prone spots, but another
OL,15,Fdry day with sunny spells and patchy
OL,16,Fcloud to follow. Winds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
